ng>1</strong></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>).</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>高一年级拔河比赛</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">——各班男女各8人，成对立面站位，1分钟内把标志带拉过本队河界为胜，若1分钟内两队都未拉过河界，则以标志带离河界近的那队获得胜利（可戴棉纱手套，三局两胜）。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>2).高二年级</strong></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>1</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>分钟跳长绳</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">——每班</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">12</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">名同学参赛，其中二人摇摆绳子，</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">10</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">人（男女不限）跳长绳，规定时间内个数多者优胜，每班有二次机会取其中最优一次成绩。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>3).高三年级“开火车”</strong></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">----</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">全程30米，男、女各5人成一路纵队全蹲，后面同学双手依次搭在前面同学的肩膀上同步往前跳，途中断开取消名次，以排头到达终点为准计时，有两次机会，用时短者优胜，取最佳成绩录取名次。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">注：集体项目（不包括</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">4*100</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">接力）在男生人数不够的情况下班级女生可代替男生</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>五.</strong></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve"><strong> </strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>参</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>加及报名办法：</strong></span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">1</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">.田径项目每人限报二项，可兼报接力，每项限报二名（</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #ff0000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">其中女子</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #ff0000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">1500</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #ff0000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">米、男女跳高限报一名</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">），接力可报六名。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 108%; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">2</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">.报名办法：</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 108%; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">各班级登录网上报名系统方法：</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">http://www.wlydh.com/tjydh/default.aspx?dw=040</span><a href="http://www.wlydh.com/tjydh/default.aspx?dw=040，"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">，</span></a><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">运动会名称：2022年绍兴一中秋季运动会。各参赛班级报名账户：点击</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><img style="HEIGHT: 0.26in; WIDTH: 0.26in" alt="202209221521341709.Jpeg" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2022/9/202209221521347937.Jpeg" /></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve">  选择、初始密码：123456。请各班及时</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">进行报名，逾期不报名视为自动弃权，报名操作过程中如有疑问，请联系体育组</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">郑祥霖</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve">老师，电话：15355528976 </span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">。报名时间2022年9月28日截止。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">注：本报名系统需要在联网的状态下才可使用，所以每班请选择一名管理员在可联网的电脑上统一进行报名。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">3</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">.比赛使用</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>最新田径竞赛规则和本次运动会的特定规则</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">4</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">.已报名的运动员比赛时不得无故弃权，每弃赛一项扣2分；更不得冒名顶替，如发现冒名顶替取消名次，并在该班团体总分中扣</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">7</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">分，对冒名顶替者进行批评教育。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>六.</strong></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve"><strong> </strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>录取及奖励办法：</strong></span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>1</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">.田径比赛录取前八名，以9、7、6、5、4、3、2、1记分，接力项目加倍计分，某项比赛不足八人，则全部录取名次。无故弃权扣2分。</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>（各年级单独的集体项目、不计入团体总分，单独发奖。）</strong></span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">2.综合考虑高三、高二个别班级男女生比例不均衡，组委会决定高三、高二分甲、乙两组录取团体总分名次。高三甲组（2班、3班、4班、10班、11班、13班、14班），高三乙组（1班、5班、6班、7班、8班、9班、12班、15班、16班）。高二甲组（1班、2班、3班、4班、5班、9班、13班），高三乙组（6班、7班、8班、10班、11班、12班、14班、15班）。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>3.</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">团体以年级评定名次，按该班男</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: 1.5pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">、</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">女运动员所得分数之和计算名次（总分相同，则以金、银、铜牌多少排列）</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: 3.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">。</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">高一年级取前</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>6</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">名；高二年级甲组取前3名，乙组取前4名；高三年级甲组取前</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>3</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">名，乙组取前</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>4</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">名颁发奖状。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>4</strong></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">.</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">400</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">米以上（含</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">400</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">米）的比赛和部分集体项目均采用分组决赛，按成绩录取名次。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>5</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">.个人项目前三名发给金、银、铜奖牌与证书。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>6</strong></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">.</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">参加男子1500米、女子</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">1500</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">米的运动员，对跑完全程到达终点的，男子加</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">3</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">分、女子加5分。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>7</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">.对于传统田径项目破校纪录者，加</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">15</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">分。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>七．注意事项</strong></span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">1</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">.参加比赛运动员，需穿短运动装和运动鞋（特殊情况例外），否则不予录取名次。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">2</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">.号码布必须</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #ff0000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">四个</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">别针佩于胸前（</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>别针自备</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">），不佩号码布者不予</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">参加比赛</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">。运动会期间，各班学生必须在指定地点就座</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">,</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">不得进入比赛场地</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">，</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">以维护良好秩序</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">，</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">特别是垒球比赛，纪检部做好清场工作，</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">确保安全，保证运动顺利进行。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">3.本次比赛场地塑胶跑道</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">，</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">比赛所用钉鞋一律要按规定的鞋钉要求</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">，</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">否则不得穿钉鞋比赛，违者赔偿场地损失费。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">4.</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>禁止穿钉鞋进入球类场地</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">，每发现一次班级总分扣10分。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">5.不明事宜由体育组负责解释 。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">6.如有变动以校园网最新通知为准。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve">                                               </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve"> </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve"> </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve"> </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve">  </span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0