T-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 108%" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve"> </span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 108%" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve"> </span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 108%" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve"> </span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>大  会  纪  律</strong></span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.2in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">一、在运动会期间，人人讲文明，讲礼貌，讲道德，讲风尚，提倡做文明观众，争创优秀运动员。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.2in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">二、服从大会指挥，按竞赛规程参加比赛。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.2in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">三、比赛时做到胜不骄，败不馁，努力拼搏，创造最佳成绩。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.2in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">四、赛前做好准备，穿好运动服装，按时参加点名，如遇到项目冲突和特殊情况时，一定要办好请假手续，不能冒名顶替。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.2in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">五、不陪跑，不在运动场地乱窜乱跑，不参加比赛的同学严格按指定位置就座观看，注意安全，防止伤害事故发生。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.2in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">六、集体项目各班要认真组织好班级参赛人员与队伍准时参加比赛。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24.8pt" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve"></span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24.8pt" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">开幕式入场的方法及要求</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">1、本次运动会以“喜迎二十大 青春接力行”为主题</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>，</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #333333; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>入场式进行评比，评出最佳组织奖若干名；</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">同时进行</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>第三套中学生广播体操《舞动青春》比赛。</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">设一等奖、二等奖、三等奖。</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #333333; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">请各班写一份</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #333333; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>100字的班级介绍词</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #333333; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">，</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #ff0000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">9.30</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #333333; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">前上交至德育处公共文件夹。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #333333; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>注</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #333333; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">：运动会入场式彩排</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #333333; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>暂定</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #ff0000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>10月6日下午，高一年级3：00，高二年级3：40，高三年级4：20</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #333333; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">，请各班级准时到田径场草坪中间集中，按统一指挥进行。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">2、各班参加入场式的人数为</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>6路</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">纵队，指定1名（女生）同学拿班级牌（必须穿旗袍，黑色皮鞋，白手套，请在</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #ff0000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">9月27日</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">大课间结束到体育组器材室领取）。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">3、班级队伍选定一名指挥员喊口令，精神饱满，朝气蓬勃，体现班级风貌。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">4、各班队伍经主席台前必须目光朝主席台（行注目礼）可以变换队形（限时1分钟，不准使用燃放礼花等影响环境物品）。展示完毕后必须成</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>6路</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">纵队以</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>跑操形式</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">（加入评分）绕场至指定地点成</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>一路</strong></span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">纵队进入（开幕式）指定地点集合。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">5、组委会确定由</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #ff0000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">高一（3）班、高一（11）班</span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">担任大会仪仗队，表现优秀的为特别贡献奖。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">6、入场式设最佳组织奖、由大会评分组评定。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">7、如有变动以校园网最新通知为准。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 1.13in" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve">                  </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve">                           </span><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">大会组委会</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in" dir="ltr"><span lang="zh-CN" style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve">                                 2022年09月22日</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 108%" dir="ltr"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px" xml:space="preserve"> </span></p>
    
